    OPT_template = "Template",
    OPT_template_TIP = "Which spells ezHeal puts on your click casts: heal and dispel on Shift and Ctrl with left, right and middle click, resurrect, second dispel and more on Shift, Ctrl or Shift+Ctrl with mouse button 4; buffs on Shift+Ctrl with left, right and middle click and on mouse button 5. Alt stays free – by default it is Blizzard's self cast key. Left click (target) and right click (menu) stay. This is the default suggestion – under “Choose keys” you put every slot on a key of your own. Always the highest rank you know. The same choice as at the top of the preview at the Click Casting window: wherever you make it, it is saved and applies in both places. " .. BUFF_HINT_EN,
